cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/scene-mcp"
abstract: "Speak 3D worlds into being from any AI agent. compose_scene turns one sentence into a placed diorama plan (mood, palette, and single-object forge prompts) over the live three.ws pipeline; build_world runs the whole pipeline server-side in one call; export_scene merges a forged diorama into one glTF binary with selectable nodes; get_scene and list_scenes read the saved gallery. No key, no signer, no payment."
version: 0.2.2
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/scene-mcp"
url: "https://three.ws"
authors:
  - name: three.ws
    website: "https://three.ws"
